nt, and construction activities, as well as dredging, excavation, and transportation of marine sand. In addition, it is involved in the food and beverage (F&B) business, including F&B shop operations, selling merchandise in store, and offering a variety of beverages and foods to customers. The company was formerly known as NWP Holdings Berhad and changed its name to Auro Holdings Berhad in June 2023. Auro Holdings Berhad was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Auro Holdings Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1999年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，前身为 NWP Holdings Berhad，于2023年6月更名。公司在马来西亚、新加坡和韩国从事木材及木制品的制造与销售，并通过木材销售、食品饮料销售及其他业务板块运营。","lines":["木材产品：制造和销售室内外模压木制品及风干/窑干锯材，客户为木材相关企业。","木材服务：提供窑干、咨询和木材处理服务，客户为木材加工商。","食品饮料：经营餐饮店铺，销售商品并提供多种饮料和食品，客户为消费者。","信息技术与贸易：提供信息技术解决方案，并贸易农产品、海鲜、沙子及其他一般产品。","海事与工程：从事船舶租赁、疏浚、挖掘和海洋沙子运输，以及物业管理、开发和建筑活动。"],"lines_en":["Timber Products: Manufacture and sale of interior and exterior molded timber products and air dried/kiln dried sawn timber to timber-related businesses.","Timber Services: Provision of kiln drying, consultancy, and timber treatment services to timber processors.","Food and Beverage: Operation of F&B shops, selling merchandise in store, and offering a variety of beverages and foods to customers.","IT and Trading: Supply of information technology solutions and trading of agricultural products, seafood, sand, and other general products.","Marine and Engineering: Vessel chartering, dredging, excavation, and transportation of marine sand, as well as property management, development, and construction activities."]}}